  "evidence_cutoff_note": "New search begins strictly after September 25 at 23:59:59 EDT. The morning monitor froze at 09:57:04 EDT and direct adjudication at 10:18 EDT; the site, committee and adjacent layers advanced the cutoff to 11:52:51 EDT. A healthy 89-route post-noon replay then closed the bounded research window at 12:21:42 EDT. Later-day high-velocity sources remain provisional.",
